// What the shaders share with the C++ core and the scripts: the streets: road materials and codes, lane tones, the wear field and the street props (render/roads, render/wear, render/props; road_body.gdshaderinc, road_wear.gdshaderinc, wear.gdshaderinc, props.gdshader). Generated by tools/build/shader_contracts.py from tools/build/shader_contracts.json: edit the table, never this file.
#ifndef CONTRACTS_STREETS_INCLUDED
